Authors and contributors:

Tk::Zinc's main author is Patrick Lecoanet (CENA).
Submodules, demos and documentation were developed by Daniel Etienne (CENA),
Christophe Mertz (formerly CENA, then IntuiLab) and Jean-Luc Vinot (CENA),
with contributions from Stéphane Chatty (IntuiLab), Céline Schlienger
(IntuiLab) and Alexandre Lemort (IntuiLab).
